<title>FRANCE: French December coffee imports rose yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French December coffee imports rose yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in December issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		   Dec 96    Dec 95   Jan/Dec 96   Jan/Dec 95</p>
<p> Ivory Coast    3,027     2,424    46,847	 44,945</p>
<p> Cameroon	   566	 552    15,781	 10,516</p>
<p> Brazil	   3,776     2,862    44,649	 51,940</p>
<p> Colombia	 2,760     2,432    33,443	 31,941</p>
<p> World total   22,374    18,780   314,490	292,239</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
